       Identification Division.                                                 
       Program-ID. F7919270.                                                    
       Author.  Henning Langfeldt Rødland.                                      
      *################################################################*        
      *                                                                         
      * Generell submodul for å konvertere mellom timestamp-formater.           
      *                                                                         
      * Man leverer enten:                                                      
      *   - Dato           (ååååmmdd)                                           
      *   - Tid                                                                 
      *     enten:                                                              
      *       - Tid-TMS        (ttmmss)                                         
      *     eller:                                                              
      *       - Tid-TMSH       (ttmmsshh)                                       
      *   - Mikro-sekunder (seks siffer, hvis ønskelig)                         
      * eller:                                                                  
      *   - timestamp      (ååååmmddttmmsshh)                                   
      * eller:                                                                  
      *   - DB2 timestamp  (åååå-mm-dd-hh.mm.ss.nnnnnn)                         
      *                                                                         
      * I retur vil man få alle tilsvarende felter utfylt.                      
      *                                                                         
      * Eksempel på anrop:                                                      
      *    Initialize                          R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
      *    Set   R7919270-Versjon        To    True                             
      *    Move  &ååååmmdd               To    R7919270-In-Dato                 
      *    Move  &ttmmss                 To    R7919270-In-Tid-TMS              
      *    Call  'F7919270'              Using R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
      *                                        R7919999-Error                   
      *    End-Call                                                             
      *    If  R7919999-Retur-Abend                                             
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraf                
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                               
      *    End-If                                                               
      *    Move  R7919270-Ut-Timestamp-DB2                                      
      *                                  To    ...                              
      *                                                                         
      *################################################################*        
      *DDMMÅÅ! Si! Endringens art                                ! 3A !         
      *----------------------------------------------------------------         
      *130924!SM ! Recompile to Cobol 6.3                   !CMAS-1886!*        
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+*        
MIPS  *280521!OBJ! Recompiled to version 6.3 (OptiMIPS)          !    !         
      *281019!IBA! Rekompilert med Cob.4.2 pga S0C7 i prodcics idag.. !         
      *----------------------------------------------------------------         
      *170904!HLR! ('Noe' er endret av Henning...? Hilsen Ingvild)    !         
      *----------------------------------------------------------------         
      *110899!SS ! Økt R7919270-Ut-Tid-TMSH fra 9(7) til 9(9)    !LI65!         
      *----------------------------------------------------------------         
      *101296!HLR! Ny modul                                      !KC24!         
      *################################################################*        
       Environment Division.                                                    
       Configuration Section.                                                   
       Special-Names.                                                           
           Decimal-Point is comma.                                              
