      *                                                                         
       Copy R7919040.                                                           
       Copy R791904W.                                                           
      *                                                                         
       Copy R7919050.                                                           
       Copy R791905W.                                                           
      *                                                                         
       Copy R7919060.                                                           
       Copy R791906W.                                                           
      *                                                                         
      *################################################################*        
       Linkage Section.                                                         
      *                                                                         
       Copy R7919270                     Replacing                              
                                               R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                         By    F7919270-Ext-IO-Area.            
       Copy R7919999.                                                           
      *                                                                         
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*        
      * Her ligger gamle versjoner av copy-området, på grunn av                 
      * versjonshåndtering.                                                     
      * Vi skal konvertere til og fra ny layout.                                
      *                                                                         
       Copy R791927G.                                                           
      *                                                                         
      *################################################################*        
       Procedure Division                Using F7919270-Ext-IO-Area             
                                               R7919999-Error.                  
                                                                                
       A000-Main                         Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Set   R7919999-Retur-Ok       To    True                             
      *                                                                         
           Perform ZI00-Konv-Input-Versjon                                      
           Perform F7919270-Konv-Timestamp                                      
           Perform ZO00-Konv-Output-Versjon                                     
      *                                                                         
           Goback.                                                              
      *################################################################*        
       F7919270-Konv-Timestamp           Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Perform B000-Initialize                                              
           Perform C000-Beregning                                               
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       B000-Initialize                   Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Set   R7919999-Retur-Ok       To    True                             
           Initialize                          R7919270-Resultat                
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
      *                                                                         
           Initialize                          W-Arbeids-Felter                 
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       C000-Beregning                    Section.                               
      *                                                                         
      * Først konverterer vi input til dato, tid og mikrosekunder.              
      *                                                                         
           Perform D000-Konv-Fra-Input                                          
      *                                                                         
      * Validerer dato og tid.                                                  
      *                                                                         
           Perform C100-Valider-Dato                                            
           Perform C200-Valider-Tid                                             
      *                                                                         
      * Deretter benytter vi TMSH til å danne alle output-datoene.              
      *                                                                         
           Perform E000-Konv-Til-Output                                         
           If  R7919999-Retur-Abend                                             
               Move  'C003'              To    R7919999-Paragraf                
               Perform Z900-Abend                                               
           End-If                                                               
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       C100-Valider-Dato                 Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Initialize                          R7919040-Valider-Dato            
           Set   R7919040-Versjon        To    True                             
           Move  W-Splitt-Dato           To    R7919040-In-Dato                 
      *                                                                         
           Perform F7919040-Valider-Dato                                        
      *                                                                         
           If  Not R7919999-Retur-OK                                            
               Move  'C101'              To    R7919999-Paragraf                
               Perform Z900-Abend                                               
           End-If                                                               
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       C200-Valider-Tid                  Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Evaluate W-S-TMS-Time                                                
           also     W-S-TMS-Minutt                                              
           also     W-S-TMS-Sekund                                              
      *                                                                         
             When 00 thru 23                                                    
             also 00 thru 59                                                    
             also 00 thru 59                                                    
               Continue                                                         
      *                                                                         
             When 24                                                            
             also 00                                                            
             also 00                                                            
               Continue                                                         
      *                                                                         
             When other                                                         
               Move  Space               To    R7919999-Melding                 
               Move  W-Splitt-TMS        To    W-Display-Tid                    
               String 'Ugyldig klokkeslett - ' Delimited by size                
                      W-Display-Tid            Delimited by size                
                      '.'                      Delimited by size                
                                         Into  R7919999-Melding                 
               End-String                                                       
               Move  'C202'              To    R7919999-Paragraf                
               Perform Z900-Abend                                               
      *                                                                         
           End-Evaluate                                                         
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       D000-Konv-Fra-Input               Section.                               
      *                                                                         
      * Uansett hva vi får input, så konverteres det til                        
      *   - W-Splitt-Dato                                                       
      *   - W-Splitt-TMS                                                        
      *   - W-Splitt-Mikro                                                      
      *                                                                         
           Move  0                       To    W-Splitt-Dato                    
           Move  0                       To    W-Splitt-TMS                     
           Move  0                       To    W-Splitt-Mikro                   
      *                                                                         
           Evaluate R7919270-In-Dato     In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
           also     R7919270-In-Tid-TMS  In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
           also     R7919270-In-Tid-TMSH In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
           also     R7919270-In-Mikro-Sek                                       
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
           also     R7919270-In-Timestamp                                       
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
           also     R7919270-In-Timestamp-DB2                                   
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
      *                                                                         
             When +0                                                            
             also +0                                                            
             also +0                                                            
             also +0                                                            
             also +0                                                            
             also space                                                         
               Move  'Ingen input-felter er utfylt.'                            
                                         To    R7919999-Melding                 
               Move  'D001'              To    R7919999-Paragraf                
               Perform Z900-Abend                                               
      *                                                                         
             When +0                                                            
             also +0                                                            
             also +0                                                            
             also +0                                                            
             also +0                                                            
             also any                                                           
               Perform D100-Konv-Fra-Timestamp-DB2                              
      *                                                                         
             When +0                                                            
             also +0                                                            
             also +0                                                            
             also +0                                                            
             also any                                                           
             also space                                                         
               Perform D200-Konv-Fra-Timestamp                                  
      *                                                                         
             When +00010101 thru +99991231                                      
             also +000001   thru +235959                                        
             also +0                                                            
             also any                                                           
             also +0                                                            
             also space                                                         
               Perform D300-Konv-Fra-Dato-TMS                                   
      *                                                                         
             When +00010101 thru +99991231                                      
             also any                                                           
             also +00000001 thru +23595999                                      
             also any                                                           
             also +0                                                            
             also space                                                         
               Perform D400-Konv-Fra-Dato-TMSH                                  
      *                                                                         
             When +00010101 thru +99991231                                      
             also +0                                                            
             also +0                                                            
             also any                                                           
             also +0                                                            
             also space                                                         
               Perform D500-Konv-Fra-Dato                                       
      *                                                                         
             When other                                                         
               Move  'Input er ikke entydig, kan ikke konvertere.'              
                                         To    R7919999-Melding                 
               Move  'D002'              To    R7919999-Paragraf                
               Perform Z900-Abend                                               
      *                                                                         
           End-Evaluate                                                         
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       D100-Konv-Fra-Timestamp-DB2       Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Move  R7919270-In-Timestamp-DB2                                      
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                         To    W-Splitt-DB2                     
      *                                                                         
           Move  W-S-DB2-Aar             To    W-S-Dato-Aar                     
           Move  W-S-DB2-Mnd             To    W-S-Dato-Mnd                     
           Move  W-S-DB2-Dag             To    W-S-Dato-Dag                     
      *                                                                         
           Move  W-S-DB2-Time            To    W-S-TMS-Time                     
           Move  W-S-DB2-Minutt          To    W-S-TMS-Minutt                   
           Move  W-S-DB2-Sekund          To    W-S-TMS-Sekund                   
      *                                                                         
           Move  W-S-DB2-Mikro           To    W-Splitt-Mikro                   
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       D200-Konv-Fra-Timestamp           Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Move  R7919270-In-Timestamp   In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                         To    W-Splitt-Timestamp               
      *                                                                         
           Move  W-S-TS-Aar              To    W-S-Dato-Aar                     
           Move  W-S-TS-Mnd              To    W-S-Dato-Mnd                     
           Move  W-S-TS-Dag              To    W-S-Dato-Dag                     
      *                                                                         
           Move  W-S-TS-Time             To    W-S-TMS-Time                     
           Move  W-S-TS-Minutt           To    W-S-TMS-Minutt                   
           Move  W-S-TS-Sekund           To    W-S-TMS-Sekund                   
      *                                                                         
           Move  W-S-TS-Hundre           To    W-S-Mikro-Hundre                 
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       D300-Konv-Fra-Dato-TMS            Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Move  R7919270-In-Dato        In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                         To    W-Splitt-Dato                    
      *                                                                         
           Move  R7919270-In-Tid-TMS     In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                         To    W-Splitt-TMS                     
      *                                                                         
      * GMjr 20010612                                                           
      *                                                                         
           Move  R7919270-In-Mikro-Sek   In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                         To    W-Splitt-Mikro                   
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       D400-Konv-Fra-Dato-TMSH           Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Move  R7919270-In-Dato        In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                         To    W-Splitt-Dato                    
      *                                                                         
           Move  R7919270-In-Tid-TMSH    In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                         To    W-Splitt-TMSH                    
      *                                                                         
      * HLR 20040917 - hundredelene fra mikro blir overskrevet med              
      *                hundredelene fra tid-tmsh.                               
           Move  R7919270-In-Mikro-Sek   In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                         To    W-Splitt-Mikro                   
      *                                                                         
           Move  W-S-TMSH-Time           To    W-S-TMS-Time                     
           Move  W-S-TMSH-Minutt         To    W-S-TMS-Minutt                   
           Move  W-S-TMSH-Sekund         To    W-S-TMS-Sekund                   
      *                                                                         
           Move  W-S-TMSH-Hundre         To    W-S-Mikro-Hundre                 
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       D500-Konv-Fra-Dato                Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Move  R7919270-In-Dato        In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                         To    W-Splitt-Dato                    
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       E000-Konv-Til-Output              Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Perform E100-Konv-Til-TMSH                                           
           Perform E200-Konv-Til-Timestamp                                      
           Perform E300-Konv-Til-Timestamp-DB2                                  
      *                                                                         
           Move  W-Splitt-Dato           To    R7919270-Ut-Dato                 
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                                                                
           Move  W-Splitt-TMS            To    R7919270-Ut-Tid-TMS              
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                                                                
           Move  W-Splitt-TMSH           To    R7919270-Ut-Tid-TMSH             
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                                                                
           Move  W-Splitt-Mikro          To    R7919270-Ut-Mikro-Sek            
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                                                                
           Move  W-Splitt-Timestamp      To    R7919270-Ut-Timestamp            
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                                                                
           Move  W-Splitt-DB2            To    R7919270-Ut-Timestamp-DB2        
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       E100-Konv-Til-TMSH                Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Move  W-S-TMS-Time            To    W-S-TMSH-Time                    
           Move  W-S-TMS-Minutt          To    W-S-TMSH-Minutt                  
           Move  W-S-TMS-Sekund          To    W-S-TMSH-Sekund                  
                                                                                
           Move  W-S-Mikro-Hundre        To    W-S-TMSH-Hundre                  
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       E200-Konv-Til-Timestamp           Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Move  W-S-Dato-Aar            To    W-S-TS-Aar                       
           Move  W-S-Dato-Mnd            To    W-S-TS-Mnd                       
           Move  W-S-Dato-Dag            To    W-S-TS-Dag                       
                                                                                
           Move  W-S-TMS-Time            To    W-S-TS-Time                      
           Move  W-S-TMS-Minutt          To    W-S-TS-Minutt                    
           Move  W-S-TMS-Sekund          To    W-S-TS-Sekund                    
                                                                                
           Move  W-S-Mikro-Hundre        To    W-S-TS-Hundre                    
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       E300-Konv-Til-Timestamp-DB2       Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Move  '0001-01-01-00.00.00.000000'                                   
                                         To    W-Splitt-DB2                     
                                                                                
           Move  W-S-Dato-Aar            To    W-S-DB2-Aar                      
           Move  W-S-Dato-Mnd            To    W-S-DB2-Mnd                      
           Move  W-S-Dato-Dag            To    W-S-DB2-Dag                      
                                                                                
           Move  W-S-TMS-Time            To    W-S-DB2-Time                     
           Move  W-S-TMS-Minutt          To    W-S-DB2-Minutt                   
           Move  W-S-TMS-Sekund          To    W-S-DB2-Sekund                   
                                                                                
           Move  W-Splitt-Mikro          To    W-S-DB2-Mikro                    
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       ZI00-Konv-Input-Versjon           Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Evaluate True                                                        
             When R7919270-Versjon       In    F7919270-Ext-IO-Area             
               Move  F7919270-Ext-IO-Area                                       
                                         To    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
      *                                                                         
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*        
      *                                                                         
             When R7919270-Versjons-Nr   In    F7919270-Ext-IO-Area             
                                         =     '19961210'                       
      *                                                                         
               Set   Address             Of    F7919270-Versjon-19961210        
                 To  Address             Of    F7919270-Ext-IO-Area             
      *                                                                         
               Initialize                      R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
               Set   R7919270-Versjon    In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                         To    True                             
      *                                                                         
               Move  R7919270-Kvalifisering                                     
                                         In    F7919270-Versjon-19961210        
                 To  R7919270-Kvalifisering                                     
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
      *                                                                         
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*        
      *                                                                         
             When R7919270-Versjons-Nr   In    F7919270-Ext-IO-Area             
                                         =     '19951231'                       
      *                                                                         
               Set   Address             Of    F7919270-Versjon-19951231        
                 To  Address             Of    F7919270-Ext-IO-Area             
      *                                                                         
               Initialize                      R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
               Set   R7919270-Versjon    In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                                         To    True                             
      *                                                                         
               Move  R7919270-Kvalifisering                                     
                                         In    F7919270-Versjon-19951231        
                 To  R7919270-Kvalifisering                                     
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
      *                                                                         
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*        
      *                                                                         
             When Other                                                         
               Move  Space               To    R7919999-Melding                 
               String 'Beklager, vi håndterer ikke versjon "'                   
                                               Delimited by size                
                      R7919270-Versjons-Nr                                      
                                         In    F7919270-Ext-IO-Area             
                                               Delimited by size                
                      '". Ta i bruk ny versjon.'                                
                                               Delimited by size                
                                         Into  R7919999-Melding                 
               End-String                                                       
               Move  'ZI01'              To    R7919999-Paragraf                
               Perform Z900-Abend                                               
      *                                                                         
           End-Evaluate                                                         
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       ZO00-Konv-Output-Versjon          Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           Evaluate True                                                        
             When R7919270-Versjon       In    F7919270-Ext-IO-Area             
               Move  R7919270-Konv-Timestamp                                    
                                         To    F7919270-Ext-IO-Area             
      *                                                                         
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*        
      *                                                                         
             When R7919270-Versjons-Nr   In    F7919270-Ext-IO-Area             
                                         =     '19961210'                       
      *                                                                         
               Set   Address             Of    F7919270-Versjon-19961210        
                 To  Address             Of    F7919270-Ext-IO-Area             
      *                                                                         
               Initialize                                                       
                     R7919270-Resultat   In    F7919270-Versjon-19961210        
               Move  R7919270-Ut-Dato    In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                 To  R7919270-Ut-Dato    In    F7919270-Versjon-19961210        
      *                                                                         
               Move  R7919270-Ut-Tid-TMS In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                 To  R7919270-Ut-Tid-TMS In    F7919270-Versjon-19961210        
      *                                                                         
               Move  R7919270-Ut-Tid-TMSH                                       
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                 To  R7919270-Ut-Tid-TMSH                                       
                                         In    F7919270-Versjon-19961210        
      *                                                                         
               Move  R7919270-Ut-Mikro-Sek                                      
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                 To  R7919270-Ut-Mikro-Sek                                      
                                         In    F7919270-Versjon-19961210        
      *                                                                         
               Move  R7919270-Ut-Timestamp                                      
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                 To  R7919270-Ut-Timestamp                                      
                                         In    F7919270-Versjon-19961210        
      *                                                                         
               Move  R7919270-Ut-Timestamp-DB2                                  
                                         In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                 To  R7919270-Ut-Timestamp-DB2                                  
                                         In    F7919270-Versjon-19961210        
      *                                                                         
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*        
      *                                                                         
             When R7919270-Versjons-Nr   In    F7919270-Ext-IO-Area             
                                         =     '19951231'                       
      *                                                                         
               Set   Address             Of    F7919270-Versjon-19951231        
                 To  Address             Of    F7919270-Ext-IO-Area             
      *                                                                         
               Initialize                                                       
                     R7919270-Resultat   In    F7919270-Versjon-19951231        
               Move  R7919270-Resultat   In    R7919270-Konv-Timestamp          
                 To  R7919270-Resultat   In    F7919270-Versjon-19951231        
      *                                                                         
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*        
      *                                                                         
             When Other                                                         
               Move  Space               To    R7919999-Melding                 
               String 'Systemfeil, vi håndterte versjon "'                      
                                               Delimited by size                
                      R7919270-Versjons-Nr                                      
                                         In    F7919270-Ext-IO-Area             
                                               Delimited by size                
                      '" inn, skulle også gjort det ut.'                        
                                               Delimited by size                
                                         Into  R7919999-Melding                 
               End-String                                                       
               Move  'ZO01'              To    R7919999-Paragraf                
               Perform Z900-Abend                                               
      *                                                                         
           End-Evaluate                                                         
      *                                                                         
           .                                                                    
      *################################################################*        
       Z900-Abend                        Section.                               
      *                                                                         
           If  Not R7919999-Retur-Abend                                         
               Move  +0                  To    R7919999-Modul-Ind               
           End-If                                                               
      *                                                                         
           Add   +1                      To    R7919999-Modul-Ind               
      *                                                                         
           If  R7919999-Modul-Ind        Not >                                  
                             ( Length    Of    R7919999-Modul-Tab               
                             / Length    Of    R7919999-Modul-Element )         
               Move  'F7919270'          To    R7919999-Modul-Navn              
                                                    (R7919999-Modul-Ind)        
               Move  R7919999-Paragraf   To    R7919999-Modul-Para              
                                                    (R7919999-Modul-Ind)        
           End-If                                                               
      *                                                                         
           Set   R7919999-Retur-Abend    To    True                             
      *                                                                         
           Goback.                                                              
      *################################################################*        
           Copy R791904P.                                                       
           Copy R791905P.                                                       
           Copy R791906P.                                                       
      *################################################################*        
